      "message": "Merge main into issue/3040-drill-undersize-fold-key\n\ncrates/ui/src/operations.rs: keep the PR's DrillUndersize key 223 and\nmain's new UndercutLift arm. UndercutLift came with key 217, the key of\nan AvoidHit on the holder (the #3040 fault), so it takes 222. Pinned by\nan_undercut_lift_never_hides_an_avoid_hit. The decision record has an\naddendum.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
